Package: uwubuntu-branding
Version: @PKG_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: UwUbuntu Developers <uwubuntu@example.org>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: base-files, plymouth, plymouth-label, fastfetch, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: yaru-theme-gtk, yaru-theme-icon, gnome-shell-extension-ubuntu-dock
Homepage: @DISTRO_HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ artwork, boot splash and desktop defaults
 Paw-print wallpapers, a fluffy Plymouth boot splash, a GRUB theme, GNOME
 defaults (orange accent, dark mode), os-release branding and some silly
 terminal toys (uwuify, uwufetch).
